(card "exp:D-R2-1_default_admit_baseline" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R2-1_default_admit_baseline"
  :body "---\nnav: 20\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R2-1_default_admit_baseline\nshort_name: default_admit_baseline\ntitle: \"D-R2-1 — default admit (no ratio gate / no volume cap / no open_3min)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.8566\ntrain_trade_count: 214\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8178\ntrain_sharpe: 6.6089\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0121\nval_nav_mean: 1.0782\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0763\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: baseline\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [baseline]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r2, axis/baseline, status/baseline, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# D-R2-1 — default admit baseline (214 trades)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team D 的 **default-admit baseline**：完全 drop anchor 的 ratio_gate / volume_cap / open_3min，所有 leg 全收 → 214 笔。train NAV 2.86 漂亮但 win_rate 81.8% < anchor 85.7%。**所有 D-R2-x blacklist 候选都以此为 reference**。与 [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R10-0__all_admit_baseline]] **bit-for-bit 相同**。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 不是 hypothesis，是 reference baseline。让后续 blacklist 候选可以直接读 \"本 blacklist add 了多少 NAV / 损失了多少 NAV\"。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 步骤：全 drop anchor 的 ratio_gate / volume_cap / open_3min；不加 blacklist。\n- 输出 214 笔。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling stat。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.8566 | 214 | 6.61 | 81.8% | -1.21% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0782 ± 0.076 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (作 reference 不上 test) | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- N/A (reference baseline)\n- 关键 risk flag：win_rate 81.8% 显著低 anchor 85.7%，max_dd -1.21% 高 anchor -1.01% —— 这 74 笔多收的 leg (vs anchor 140) 整体 quality 差。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **bit_for_bit_same_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R10-0__all_admit_baseline]]\n- **base_for**:\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-2__blacklist_cross_source]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-4__blacklist_stack_quad]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]] (default-admit vs default-drop)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R2-1 row)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- D-R2-1 / B-R10-0 同一 pool 不同 team 重跑 = sanity check helper 一致性。下次 cross-team baseline 必须用同一 pool reproduce。\n- **核心 lesson**: default-admit baseline train NAV +31% vs anchor 但 win/sharpe/dd 都差 —— 说明多收的 74 笔有大量 \"low-quality leg\"。D 队/B 队后续的 blacklist 努力本质上都在尝试\"把这 74 笔的烂部分砍掉\"，但 hold-out 上 train-fit blacklist 都没法保留这种区分能力。\n"
